            # WAL mode: concurrent read/write, performans patlamasÃƒÆ’Ã†â€™ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã‚ÂÃƒÆ’Ã¢â‚¬Å¡Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â±
            try:
                con.execute("PRAGMA journal_mode=WAL")
                con.execute("PRAGMA synchronous=NORMAL")
                # D300 RTX5090 + 192GB RAM: agresif cache (256 MB) + 2 GB mmap
                con.execute("PRAGMA cache_size=-262144")  # 256 MB cache
                con.execute("PRAGMA temp_store=MEMORY")
                con.execute("PRAGMA mmap_size=2147483648")  # 2 GB mmap
                con.execute("PRAGMA page_size=8192")  # 8KB page (default 4KB)
                con.execute("PRAGMA wal_autocheckpoint=10000")  # 10K page'de checkpoint
                con.execute("PRAGMA busy_timeout=10000")  # 10 sn lock bekleme
            except Exception:
                pass

